<?php

namespace Pest\PendingCalls;

/**
 * Pest annotates this class `@mixin HigherOrderCallables|TestCase|Testable`.
 * PHPStan reads that as a union and requires a method to exist on every member
 * of it, so `arch()->expect(...)` resolves against PHPUnit's TestCase, is not
 * found there, and every architecture rule in the suite collapses to `mixed` —
 * eighty-odd errors, none of them about this codebase.
 *
 * Everything below is true at runtime: `__call()` and `__get()` both hand back
 * the same TestCall, which is the whole mechanism behind
 * `arch()->expect(...)->not->toUse(...)`. The names are enumerated rather than
 * left to `__call()` because `phpstan-strict-rules` reports a call that only a
 * magic method answers — correctly, and we want that rule left on for our own
 * code. The list is derived from Pest's own sources; regenerate it by grepping
 * `vendor/pestphp/pest-plugin-arch/src` and `vendor/pestphp/pest/src/Mixins`
 * for `public function to*`.
 *
 * A stub replaces a declaration wholesale rather than merging into it, so this
 * is all PHPStan will see of the class. Nothing here is asserted about
 * behaviour: every method returns the same object it returns in Pest.
 *
 * @property-read self $not
 * @property-read self $and
 * @property-read self $each
 * @method self abstractClasses(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self after(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self assignee(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self before(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self classes(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self covers(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self coversClass(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self coversNothing(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self custom(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self defer(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self depends(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self enums(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self expect(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self group(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self ignoring(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self interfaces(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self issue(mixed ...$arguments)
 * @method self laravel(mixed ...$arguments)
